        "8020": {"synopsis":"Tests BREAK: carry unless both SPACE (port $7FFE bit 0) and CAPS SHIFT (port $FEFE bit 0)\nare down.\nChanges: AF.","comment":"Port $7FFE: B to SPACE"},
