        "8032": {"synopsis":"DEF FN: running, the statement is skipped (DATA_SKIP with DEF FN's token). Checking: a\nletter (and '$'), '(', the parameters, ')', '=' and an expression of the name's type (report\nC otherwise). After each parameter 6 bytes are made, the marker $0E and room for its value,\nwhich FN fills.\nObserved: 10 DEF FN f(x,y)=x*y+1 was stored with 0E and 5 bytes after x and after y; those\nbytes held leftovers until a call put 3 and 4 there.","comment":"Checking?"},
        "8035": {"comment":"Yes: the checks"},
