        "8137": {"synopsis":"LPRINT: PRINT_START with stream 3 (the printer).","comment":"Stream 3: the printer"},
        "8139": {"comment":"On as PRINT"},
        "8141": {"synopsis":"PRINT: PRINT_START with stream 2 (the upper screen).\nObserved: PRINT \"a\";\"b\";\"c\",\"d\"'\"e\" printed abc, d at column 16, e on the next line; PRINT\nAT 3,4;\"x\";TAB 9;\"y\" put x at column 4 and y at 9 of line 3; PRINT INK 2;\"z\" gave the cell\nattribute $3A.","comment":"Stream 2: the upper screen"},
        "8143": {"synopsis":"When running, stream A becomes current (STREAM_SELECT); the temporary colours from the\npermanent ones; the print list (PRINT_LIST); the statement must end there.","comment":"Checking?"},
