        "8159": {"synopsis":"Prints a list of items and separators (PRINT and INPUT's prompt): separators by PRINT_SEP,\nitems by PRINT_ITEM, until the end of the statement or a ')'. A list that does not end with\na separator ends with ENTER (PRINT_NEWLINE).\nObserved: PRINT \"no newline\"; left the position on the same line.","comment":"The current character"},
