        "8683": {"comment":"';'?"},
        "8685": {"comment":"Yes: the next item"},
        "8687": {"comment":"Anything else: report C"},
        "8690": {"synopsis":"A colour item in a print list or a graphics statement, INK to OVER ($D9-$DE): past the\nkeyword, then COL_TEMP_ITEM. Carry when A is not one.","comment":"Below INK?"},
        "8692": {"comment":"Then carry: not one"},
        "8693": {"comment":"Above OVER?"},
        "8695": {"comment":"Carry when it is"},
        "8696": {"comment":"Not one"},
        "8697": {"comment":"The keyword kept"},
        "8698": {"comment":"Past it"},
        "8699": {"comment":"The keyword back"},
        "8700": {"synopsis":"Sets one temporary colour item: A - $C9 is its control code ($10 INK ... $15 OVER); the\nnumber after it (CLASS_6) is printed after the code through the current channel (RST $10\ntwice), so SCREEN_OUTPUT takes it to SET_TEMP_ATTR. Only checked when checking (RUN_ONLY).","comment":"A = the control code, $10-$15"},
        "8702": {"comment":"Kept"},
        "8703": {"comment":"The number"},
        "8706": {"comment":"The control code back"},
        "8707": {"comment":"Carry clear: a colour item"},
        "8708": {"comment":"Checking: done"},
        "8711": {"comment":"The code kept"},
        "8712": {"comment":"A = the number"},
        "8715": {"comment":"D = it"},
        "8716": {"comment":"The code back"},
        "8717": {"comment":"Printed"},
        "8718": {"comment":"A = the number"},
        "8719": {"comment":"Printed"},
        "8721": {"synopsis":"Sets a temporary colour or effect: control code A ($10-$15) with value D, from\nSCREEN_OUTPUT's OUT_OPERANDS.\n1. INK and PAPER (COL_INK_PAPER): 0-7 into ATTR_T; 8 keeps the screen's (MASK_T); 9 a\n   contrasting colour (P_FLAG bit 4 or 6, which OUT_ATTR applies); 10 or more is report K.\n2. FLASH and BRIGHT (COL_FLASH_BRIGHT): 0 or 1 into ATTR_T bit 7 or 6; 8 keeps the screen's;\n   anything else report K.\n3. INVERSE and OVER: 0 or 1 into P_FLAG bit 2 or 0; anything else report K.\nObserved: PAPER 1; INK 9 printed x on $0F, PAPER 6; INK 9 y on $30; INK 8; PAPER 8; BRIGHT 1\nover a PAPER 2 cell gave $50; INK 10, FLASH 2 and BORDER 8 gave \"K Invalid colour\".","comment":"INK: $FF; PAPER: 0"},
        "8723": {"comment":"INK: 0 and carry; PAPER: 0"},
        "8725": {"comment":"INK or PAPER (carry for INK)"},
        "8727": {"comment":"FLASH: $FF; BRIGHT: 0"},
        "8729": {"comment":"FLASH: 0 and carry; BRIGHT: 0"},
        "8731": {"comment":"FLASH or BRIGHT (carry for FLASH)"},
        "8733": {"comment":"INVERSE (1) or OVER (2)?"},
        "8735": {"comment":"A = the value"},
        "8736": {"comment":"OVER: bit 0"},
        "8738": {"comment":"OVER: on"},
        "8740": {"comment":"INVERSE: the value moved to bit 2"},
        "8742": {"comment":"Bit 2"},
        "8744": {"synopsis":"INVERSE (B = 4, the value at bit 2) or OVER (B = 1): only 0 or 1; into P_FLAG\n(COL_CHANGE_BITS).","comment":"C = the moved value"},
        "8745": {"comment":"A = the value"},
        "8746": {"comment":"2 or more?"},
        "8748": {"comment":"Then report K"},
        "8750": {"comment":"A = the moved value"},
        "8751": {"comment":"HL = P_FLAG"},
        "8754": {"comment":"Its bit set from it"},
        "8756": {"synopsis":"INK (B = 7: bits 0-2) or PAPER (B = $38: the value moved to bits 3-5).","comment":"A = the value"},
        "8757": {"comment":"INK: bits 0-2"},
        "8759": {"comment":"INK: on"},
        "8761": {"comment":"PAPER: the value moved to bits 3-5"},
        "8764": {"comment":"Bits 3-5"},
