        "8850": {"comment":"MASK_T's bit"},
        "8852": {"synopsis":"BORDER: the colour (0-7, else report K) goes to port $FE, which sets the border and leaves\nMIC and EAR 0; BORDCR becomes that colour as the paper (bits 3-5) with ink 7 on a dark one\n(0-3) or 0 on a light one (4-7), the lower screen's colours.\nObserved: BORDER 2 left BORDCR $17, BORDER 5 $28.","comment":"A = the colour"},
        "8855": {"comment":"8 or more?"},
