        "9090": {"synopsis":"DRAW x,y[,a] (the colour items and x, y by CLASS_9): without a, a straight line from COORDS\nby x, y (LINE_DRAW). With a, an arc turning through a radians (DRAW_ARC).\nObserved: PLOT 10,10: DRAW 20,5 left COORDS 30,15; DRAW 250,0 from there drew to the right\nedge and gave report B; PLOT 100,50: DRAW 50,0,PI ended at 150,50.","comment":"The current character"},
        "9091": {"comment":"','?"},
