        "10623": {"comment":"Tested"},
        "10625": {"synopsis":"Found: a string parameter's 5 bytes are copied onto the calculator stack (MOVE_FP, STKEND\nmoved on); a number's are left at HL + 1, after its $0E.","comment":"A number?"},
        "10627": {"comment":"Yes: HL at its $0E, 5 bytes after"},
        "10629": {"comment":"HL = the string's 5 bytes"},
