        "11007": {"synopsis":"Assigns the value just evaluated to the variable at DEST (CLASS_1):\n1. A new number (FLAGX bit 1): the name made at the end of the variables, a single letter as\n   $60 + letter, a long name in lower case without spaces, bit 7 on its last letter ($A0 +\n   its first); then the value's 5 bytes.\n2. An existing number: the 5 bytes over its value.\n3. A whole string (FLAGX bit 0): a new copy made at the end of the variables (L_STRING_NEW),\n   the old one removed.\n4. Part of a string (an element or a slice): the value is cut or padded with spaces to that\n   length.\nObserved: LET Total Sum=3: LET q=7 made B4 6F 74 61 6C 73 75 ED and 71, each followed by\ntheir 5 bytes; LET q=9 changed only q's; LET a$=\"hi\" after \"hello\" left 41 02 00 68 69; with\na$ = \"hello\", a$(2 TO 3)=\"XYZ\" gave hXYlo; DIM c$(3): c$=\"ABCDE\" gave ABC, c$=\"X\" X and two\nspaces.","comment":"HL = DEST"},
        "11010": {"comment":"FLAGX bit 1: a new variable?"},
        "11014": {"comment":"No: an existing one"},
        "11016": {"comment":"BC = 5 for the value"},
        "11019": {"synopsis":"One more letter or digit counted (BC)."},
        "11020": {"synopsis":"The name's next character in the line: spaces and colour codes skipped.","comment":"The next character"},
        "11022": {"comment":"A space?"},
        "11024": {"comment":"Skipped"},
        "11026": {"comment":"Printable: a letter or digit?"},
        "11028": {"comment":"Below the colour codes ($10)?"},
        "11030": {"comment":"Then the name's end"},
        "11032": {"comment":"Past the colour codes ($10-$15)?"},
        "11034": {"comment":"Then the name's end"},
        "11036": {"comment":"The code's parameter skipped"},
        "11037": {"comment":"On with the next"},
        "11039": {"synopsis":"A letter or digit counts; '$' makes a string (L_NEW_STR).","comment":"A letter or digit?"},
        "11042": {"comment":"Then counted"},
        "11044": {"comment":"'$'?"},
        "11046": {"comment":"Then a new string"},
