        "11266": {"synopsis":"DIM: the name must be followed by '(' (else report C); checking, the subscripts are checked\n(VAR_SUBSCRIPTS). Running: an old array of the name is removed, and a new one made at the\nend of the variables: its first byte (bit 7 set), its length, the number of dimensions, each\ndimension (a word), then the elements, numbers 5 bytes of 0, characters spaces.\nObserved: DIM a(2,3): DIM b$(4) made 81 23 00 02 02 00 03 00 and 30 zeros, then C2 07 00 01\n04 00 and 4 spaces.","comment":"The name looked up (LOOK_VARS)"},
        "11269": {"synopsis":"Report C."},
