        "12490": {"synopsis":"multiply ($04): two small integers are multiplied in 16 bits when the product fits\n(HL_HL_X_DE); otherwise in the full form: 33 rounds of shift and add over both register\nsets, the exponents added (RESULT_EXPONENT).\nObserved: 300*300 printed 90000.","comment":"Both exponent bytes 0 (both small integers)?"},
