        "12604": {"comment":"Carry = the sum's ninth bit, inverted"},
        "12605": {"synopsis":"The result's exponent from the two (added for multiply, subtracted for division) less the\nbias: too big is report 6, too small gives 0.\nObserved: 1E38*10 gave report 6; 1E-38/1E10 printed 0.","comment":"Bit 7 flipped through the carry: the $80 bias taken off"},
        "12608": {"comment":"Positive: in range"},
