        "12719": {"synopsis":"division ($05): both in the full form; dividing by 0 is report 6, 0 divided gives 0; a\nrestoring division over both register sets, 32 quotient bits and one for rounding; the\nexponents subtracted (RESULT_EXPONENT).\nObserved: 7/2 printed 3.5, 1/3 0.33333333."},
        "12722": {"comment":"HL = the divisor"},
